chmod +x collect-rhacm-logs.sh
./collect-rhacm-logs.sh
Deliverable: a timestamped rhacm-logs-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS/ directory containing five .log files, listed by the script's final ls -la command.

Subtask 1.2: Analyzing Managed Cluster Logs and Metrics
Step 1: Create a managed cluster log analyzer

cat > analyze-cluster-logs.sh << 'EOF'
#!/bin/bash

CLUSTER_NAME=${1:-cluster1}
echo "Analyzing logs for cluster: $CLUSTER_NAME"

echo "=== Cluster Status ==="
oc get managedcluster "$CLUSTER_NAME" -o yaml | grep -A 10 "conditions:"

