echo "Cluster Lease Status:"
oc get lease -n open-cluster-management-agent "cluster-lease-$CLUSTER_NAME" 2>/dev/null || echo "No lease found with that name (check exact lease naming in your environment)"
EOF

chmod +x network-connectivity-test.sh
./network-connectivity-test.sh cluster1
Expected output: the cluster API endpoint URL, a healthz response (or an explicit "not reachable" message), Running klusterlet agent pods, and the presence of bootstrap/hub-kubeconfig secrets.

